OL,3,GNEWSAPlanners block new petrol station
OL,4,Anear Creeslough blast site
OL,5,
OL,6,FA decision to grant planning permission
OL,7,Ffor a new petrol station near the site
OL,8,Fof a deadly explosion in Creeslough,
OL,9,FCounty Donegal, four years ago has been
OL,10,Foverturned.
OL,12,FThe blast, which killed 10 people,
OL,13,Fhappened at a service station in the
OL,14,FCounty Donegal village on 7 October
OL,15,F2022.
OL,17,FIn March, Donegal County Council
OL,18,Fapproved a planning application
OL,19,Fpermitting the construction of a new
OL,20,Fservice station in the village, close
OL,21,Fto the site of the blast.
OL,23,APub: 13-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
