OL,3,GNEWSAPlanners block new petrol station
OL,4,Anear Creeslough blast site
OL,5,
OL,6,FOn Tuesday, An Coimisiun Pleanala (the
OL,7,FRepublic of Ireland's planning
OL,8,Fcommission) refused permission
OL,9,Ffollowing an appeal by some relatives
OL,10,Fof those killed in the explosion.
